<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Main Street cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Main Street cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Raymond James said it downgraded Main Street &amp; Main Inc to neutral from buy.</p>
<p>-- shares fell 1/8 to two.</p>
</text>
